    {
      "id": 19,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        30,
        1380
      ],
      "size": [
        900,
        760
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 5,
      "mode": 0,
      "showAdvanced": null,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "How to use",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# BOOGU Edit Turbo · LITE\n\n4 steps / CFG 1 / lcm / sgm_uniform. auto_steps=off keeps the step count fixed. Shift 3.16 comes from the model.\n\nLoad a source near 1 MP in Canvas, enter the edit instruction, then Queue → Review → Accept.\n\nLITE edits the whole image. Open FULL for masked editing.\n\nTextEncodeBooguEdit sends the reference to both CFG branches and vision tokens to positive conditioning. Start with one reference. Describe the desired style in the edit instruction.\n\nAt CFG 1, the negative prompt has no effect. Do not add a distillation LoRA to already distilled Turbo weights. Do not use Base or standard Edit weights with the four-step recipe.\n\nEdit-Turbo hotfix 1k 20260708 INT8: start with a source near 1024×1024. LCM / sgm_uniform follows the ComfyUI Turbo path for these edit weights.\n\nhttps://huggingface.co/Boogu/Boogu-Image-0.1-Base\nhttps://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Boogu-Image\nhttps://docs.comfy.org/tutorials/image/boogu/boogu-image-0.1\n\n### Checked recipe\nBoogu Turbo: 4 steps, CFG 1, lcm / sgm_uniform. Sampler profile checks model and latent compatibility. Profiles do not select weights: Base, Turbo, Distilled and Edit checkpoints are not interchangeable. Use a fixed seed when comparing changes; increase size only after the prompt and composition work. Negative text has no sampling effect at CFG 1."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "# BOOGU Edit Turbo · LITE\n\n4 steps / CFG 1 / lcm / sgm_uniform. auto_steps=off keeps the step count fixed. Shift 3.16 comes from the model.\n\nLoad a source near 1 MP in Canvas, enter the edit instruction, then Queue → Review → Accept.\n\nLITE edits the whole image. Open FULL for masked editing.\n\nTextEncodeBooguEdit sends the reference to both CFG branches and vision tokens to positive conditioning. Start with one reference. Describe the desired style in the edit instruction.\n\nAt CFG 1, the negative prompt has no effect. Do not add a distillation LoRA to already distilled Turbo weights. Do not use Base or standard Edit weights with the four-step recipe.\n\nEdit-Turbo hotfix 1k 20260708 INT8: start with a source near 1024×1024. LCM / sgm_uniform follows the ComfyUI Turbo path for these edit weights.\n\nhttps://huggingface.co/Boogu/Boogu-Image-0.1-Base\nhttps://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Boogu-Image\nhttps://docs.comfy.org/tutorials/image/boogu/boogu-image-0.1\n\n### Checked recipe\nBoogu Turbo: 4 steps, CFG 1, lcm / sgm_uniform. Sampler profile checks model and latent compatibility. Profiles do not select weights: Base, Turbo, Distilled and Edit checkpoints are not interchangeable. Use a fixed seed when comparing changes; increase size only after the prompt and composition work. Negative text has no sampling effect at CFG 1."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
